---
args: { decisions: DecisionAtom[], prepared: PreparedEvidence, input: CaseInput }
returns: DraftScopeClarification
---
Construct a ScopeClarification draft with its actual domain fields. Only supported values enter `values`; preserve conflicts, missing fields and evidence bindings. Form precise clarification requests describing the disputed boundary and desired acceptance. Interpret replies at the commitment level, preserve qualifications, and avoid treating general cooperation language as acceptance of a specific responsibility.
